{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_034ayu02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_034ayu02_title", "source_sha256": "e6013e310e734f35de961f3304906f0b92a2fee119fc1aaf8f125d66c8998647", "ja": "歩とおでかけ2", "zh": "和步外出2", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_034ayu02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_034ayu02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "2b95ac5e27a6297e858cd5dfffb3dd92de2dd4299f1eda8285e502ec04788b17", "ja": "歩とおでかけした一幕です。", "zh": "这是和步一起外出时的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_034ayu02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_034ayu02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "f3afeff0731d698a988cc92b700a18caa76c25948dc2456ab255edd9229b658d", "ja": "（歩と一緒に宍道湖へ来た。ああ、なんて\n綺麗な夕日なんだろう……）", "zh": "（和步一起来到了宍道湖。啊，多么美丽的夕阳啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_034ayu02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_034ayu02_1001_034ayu", "source_sha256": "e1866b6b2df0a4ddf3ba13ff00a6f4ae371e8c2a47d19318a7fa48e8b4472ed8", "ja": "マイガ～……。なんかこう……エモいな。", "zh": "我的天～……怎么说呢……真有种特别的感觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_034ayu02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_034ayu02_1002_p", "source_sha256": "3d89276415b7a921137c20c929ef4ebffbc53c35824494ef5279a6c6e75a0f2f", "ja": "ああ。\nこういうのを、エモいって言うんだろうな……。", "zh": "啊。\n这种感觉，应该就叫“很有感觉”吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_034ayu02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_034ayu02_1003_034ayu", "source_sha256": "577e7bec8ac9b278413d49ebb1c867788d96cfcb7174b3ba7b0dbc7a9498d2c1", "ja": "アタシ今、心が……エモ散らかしてる……。\n今だったら、普段言えないことも言えそうだよ。", "zh": "我现在心里……满满都是这种情绪……。\n要是现在的话，感觉平时说不出口的话也能说出来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_034ayu02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_034ayu02_1004_p", "source_sha256": "a7a672efe816ac6d0190701ddfb70a6a33450f155f06a089b6b84ce00cb3c891", "ja": "普段言えないこと……ああ、体重のこととかか？", "zh": "平时说不出口的话……哦，是体重之类的事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_034ayu02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_034ayu02_1005_034ayu", "source_sha256": "59209882055e2caf0a28b6a7caa5f816c8b8ba3d9ab96595b3f89418a82b0af5", "ja": "ち、違うよ！　てか、なんで今それ言うの！？\n雰囲気台無しじゃん！　……もういい、言わない。", "zh": "不、不是啦！话说，为什么偏偏现在提这个啊！？\n气氛全被破坏了！……算了，我不说了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_034ayu02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_034ayu02_1006_p", "source_sha256": "2808ad675b71685eadbc85365bf5361f711d992fab44f002f55ab16938fad406", "ja": "あっ、ご、ごめん。\n歩がいつも気にしてるから、つい……悪かった。", "zh": "啊，对、对不起。因为步一直很在意这个，我就不由得……抱歉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_034ayu02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_034ayu02_1007_034ayu", "source_sha256": "7191fbd810d7236876bf1485c7f8f9aad17b0bffb91934a1d05658755dc1b291", "ja": "……へへっ。うーそだよー！　怒ってないよ。\nあははっ！", "zh": "……嘿嘿。骗你的啦——！我没生气哦。\n啊哈哈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_034ayu02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_034ayu02_1008_034ayu", "source_sha256": "45ca7d43f2e88a61fac04f3c5a67ac37c5ff221cb30eb0e7aa4bdf9746eca786", "ja": "まあ、アタシが言いたかったのはさ。\nなんていうか、こういう日常、っていうのかな……。", "zh": "其实，我想说的是啦。\n该怎么说呢，就是这样的日常吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_034ayu02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_034ayu02_1009_034ayu", "source_sha256": "e37f856239bc02db52509b9c525fff4c7e4e9f81634a6a611a76c9caabef26fa", "ja": "{$P$}とのなにげない日常が、\n大好きだ、ってこと。……て、照れるな、ちょっと。", "zh": "就是说，我很喜欢和{$P$}在一起的\n这种平淡日常。……哈、还挺不好意思的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_034ayu02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_034ayu02_1010_p", "source_sha256": "d0625207a1bcd1746ae2ba58858eb9e39ec669b03a89d557bc37790e6d0267a5", "ja": "歩……。", "zh": "步……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_034ayu02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_034ayu02_1011_p", "source_sha256": "961d7557da69c657ac89fc96f7b042aea3ba9316485547d91cce9f325e4dd181", "ja": "（そう言って夕日に目をやった歩の横顔は、とても\nエモかった。こんな日があるから、頑張れるんだよな）", "zh": "说完，朝夕阳望去的步的侧脸，真是太有感觉了。正因为有这样的日子，才能努力下去啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
